 gas processing anchor employment, and new activity concentrates in the Punxsutawney and Brookville industrial parks; steep plateau terrain and legacy bituminous mining limit sites outside the boroughs.</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;color:#888888;padding-top:6px;\">Source: U.S. Census Bureau · Data verified: November 8, 2026</div></div>"],"feats":[["Jefferson County Boundary",0,[[41.09663,-79.21112],[41.07883,-79.2113],[41.07887,-79.21451],[41.05079,-79.21499],[41.04919,-79.21496],[41.04898,-79.21016],[41.02185,-79.21092],[40.96106,-79.21278],[40.93922,-79.2155],[40.91189,-79.21546],[40.91205,-79.17864],[40.91163,-79.14199],[40.91075,-79.11629],[40.91012,-79.10699],[40.90989,-79.08863],[40.90962,-79.04501],[40.90954,-79.0268],[40.9089,-79.00287],[40.90938,-78.94852],[40.90797,-78.94048],[40.9077,-78.91214],[40.90568,-78.87713],[40.90635,-78.87029],[40.90635,-78.86722],[40.90667,-78.8466],[40.90556,-78.80521],[40.92698,-78.8046],[41.03252,-78.80417],[41.04878,-78.80462],[41.06233,-78.80377],[41.07954,-78.80444],[41.08934,-78.80459],[41.13219,-78.80453],[41.15179,-78.79369],[41.17904,-78.77913],[41.20238,-78.76651],[41.20188,-78.70996],[41.23103,-78.71],[41.23079,-78.73915],[41.25387,-78.7395],[41.26162,-78.73607],[41.29499,-78.81085],[41.31829,-78.86321],[41.36089,-78.95911],[41.37132,-78.95931],[41.37104,-78.9598],[41.3704,-78.96075],[41.3701,-78.9614],[41.36973,-78.96255],[41.36955,-78.96363],[41.36958,-78.96431],[41.36967,-78.96471],[41.37025,-78.96624],[41.37046,-78.96666],[41.37066,-78.96686],[41.37096,-78.96704],[41.37146,-78.96724],[41.37195,-78.96734],[41.37221,-78.96736],[41.37237,-78.96741],[41.37309,-78.96777],[41.37336,-78.96797],[41.37404,-78.96863],[41.37463,-78.96907],[41.37537,-78.96972],[41.37563,-78.97001],[41.3759,-78.97042],[41.37627,-78.97139],[41.37634,-78.97185],[41.37632,-78.97243],[41.37615,-78.97289],[41.37599,-78.9733],[41.37578,-78.97364],[41.37555,-78.97392],[41.37505,-78.9746],[41.37476,-78.97495],[41.37381,-78.9756],[41.37313,-78.976